Open `http://localhost:3000` in a browser. Click **“Log in with Twitter”**, authorize the app, and you’ll be redirected back to the home page. If you open the app in two different browsers (or incognito windows) and both users have overlapping hashtags/keywords, they’ll appear under **“Potential Matches”**.

